       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-COAXIAL-SCSI.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-COAXIAL-SCSI-PROOFS.
           05  WS-HARDWARE-REG-MAP-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KEYCODE-SCSI-LOOP-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DYNAMIC-INTEROP-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-OOK-LORA-MODULATION-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COAXIAL-SCSI-SEAL-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-COAXIAL-SCSI-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-SCSI-PROVEN          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-SCSI-CODE          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-REGISTERS-AND-SCSI.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-INTEROP-AND-MODULATION.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-SCSI-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-REGISTERS-AND-SCSI.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HARDWARE-REG-MAP-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-KEYCODE-SCSI-LOOP-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-INTEROP-AND-MODULATION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DYNAMIC-INTEROP-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-OOK-LORA-MODULATION-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-SCSI-PROOFS.
           IF WS-HARDWARE-REG-MAP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-KEYCODE-SCSI-LOOP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DYNAMIC-INTEROP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-OOK-LORA-MODULATION-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-COAXIAL-SCSI-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-SCSI-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-SCSI-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-SCSI-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-SCSI-CODE.
